        "notes": "If you have the money, you can go for  [Dampener Grip](item_451f8c81-1821-48a4-a980-ae1cebd61a85) to boost your AP and reduce your cooldowns by swinging that big hammer of yours. If you don't have the cash or you feel like this item is unfit for your playstyle, just go for AP with two rare items. This round we want to go for raw damage using AP - we will shift towards items with more utility in the next rounds.",
