        "created_at": "2025-08-11T22:37:18.83983+00:00",
        "notes": "If paired against [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6) or [Orisa](hero_91644d44-1093-4f62-ac51-020975465e85) we go for [Vroom Boom Boom](item_b016a02c-50bd-4010-91bb-661c1101ade7). If the enemy [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6) is not very aware we can go for  [Impact Burst](item_01fa37d8-4355-4ec2-a9af-59bf030e2882).\n\nAnother fun combo is [Magma Strike](item_6d8d893f-d161-4e10-a084-4a5749b12990) combined with [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98). Especially not-so-mobile characters get slowed inside your lava. It is a worthwhile option, but it may not outweigh your preference for CR with  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e).",
